pi.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122136","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122136","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122136.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122136.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122135.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis changes two things related to the animation editor's alphabetical sorting:\r\n\r\n1. Tracks animating properties of the `root_node` of the `AnimationPlayer` are now correctly sorted based on its node name, rather than the relative path to itself (i.e. `.`). This is achieved by moving the updating and caching of the track text from `NOTIFICATION_DRAW` in `AnimationTrackEditor` to instead happen in `_update_tracks`, allowing the sorting and drawing to share the same logic/value.\r\n2. Both the group and track sorting now uses `NaturalNoCaseComparator` as opposed to the lexicographical sort of `String::operator<`, which seems better suited for alphabetical sorting.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122136/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}